Package: proMotif
Type: Package
Title: Promoter Transcription-Factor Binding-Site Scanner
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Can", "Ozcan", email = "s.canozcan89@gmail.com",
                  role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Scan a gene's promoter for transcription-factor binding sites using
    JASPAR and HOCOMOCO position weight matrices. For a gene symbol and a TF,
    it enumerates the gene's transcripts from Ensembl, fetches each promoter
    window (with a UCSC fallback when Ensembl is unavailable), scans both
    strands, and reports predicted sites in TSS-relative and absolute genomic
    coordinates with per-transcript and genomic plots. Includes a Shiny app.
    Reuses the GLproxScape package's Ensembl/JASPAR/HOCOMOCO fetchers and
    motif-scan conventions.
